@coverage jsEval
return Math.floor($slots.stock / $slots.dailyConsumption);

@answer jsEval
const days = $coverage;
const mustOrder = days <= $slots.leadTime;
return "The stock covers " + days + " whole days, and " + (mustOrder ? "the order must" : "the order does not need to") + " be placed today.";
```

